    "title": "Regional Home Builders Group Earns National Growth Awards - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By bryanvish ,\n15 hours ago ADRIAN — The Home Builders Association of Jackson, Hillsdale and Lenawee has received multiple national Grand Awards from the National Association of Home Builders for membership growth. The local association earned top honors in both numerical growth and percentage growth, placing it among leading home builders groups nationwide. Executive... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
